{"speciesId":508,"names":{"fr":"Mastouffe","es":"Stoutland","en":"Stoutland","ja":"ムーランド"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il sauve les gens bloqués dans les montagnes par des tempêtes de neige. Ses longs poils le protègent du froid."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It rescues people stranded by blizzards in the mountains. Its shaggy fur shields it from the cold."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il est spécialisé dans l’assistance aux personnes perdues en mer ou en montagne. Il est très intelligent."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"This extremely wise Pokémon excels at rescuing people stranded at sea or in the mountains."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Being wrapped in its long fur is so comfortable that a person would be fine even overnight on a wintry mountain."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Being wrapped in its long fur is so comfortable that a person would be fine even overnight on a wintry mountain."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il sauve les gens bloqués dans les montagnes par des tempêtes de neige. Ses longs poils le protègent du froid."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Socorre a humanos perdidos en montañas azotadas por ventiscas. Su largo pelaje le protege del frío."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It rescues people stranded by blizzards in the mountains. Its shaggy fur shields it from the cold."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"吹雪で 閉ざされた 山に 入り 遭難した 人を 助ける。 長い 毛が 寒さを 防ぐ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Sa soyeuse fourrure à poils longs est assez chaude pour supporter de longues nuits d’hiver en montagne."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Un humano podría pasar una noche gélida en las montañas sin pasar frío si se tapara con su largo y tupido pelaje."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Being wrapped in its long fur is so comfortable that a person would be fine even overnight on a wintry mountain."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"長い 体毛に 包まれると 冬山でも 一晩 平気なほど 暖かく とても 心地よい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il sauve les gens bloqués dans les montagnes par des tempêtes de neige. Ses longs poils le protègent du froid."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Socorre a humanos perdidos en montañas azotadas por ventiscas. Su largo pelaje le protege del frío."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It rescues people stranded by blizzards in the mountains. Its shaggy fur shields it from the cold."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"吹雪で 閉ざされた 山に 入り 遭難した 人を 助ける。 長い 毛が 寒さを 防ぐ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sa soyeuse fourrure à poils longs est assez chaude pour supporter de longues nuits d’hiver en montagne."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Un humano podría pasar una noche gélida en las montañas sin pasar frío si se tapara con su largo y tupido pelaje."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Being wrapped in its long fur is so comfortable that a person would be fine even overnight on a wintry mountain."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"長い 体毛に 包まれると 冬山でも 一晩 平気なほど 暖かく とても 心地よい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Sagesse, gentillesse et bravoure sont les mots qui qualifient le mieux ce Pokémon, devenu l’inséparable partenaire des équipes de secours."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"A su inteligencia y carácter afable se suma su valentía. Presta una ayuda inestimable a los equipos de rescate."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Intelligent, good-natured, and valiant, it’s a trustworthy partner on rescue teams."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"賢く 温厚で 勇敢。 レスキュー隊の 隊員たちの 頼れる 相棒 だぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Modèle de sagesse, il ne s’en prend jamais aux humains sans raison, et assume volontiers le rôle de nounou pour les parents occupés."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Debido a su inteligencia y a lo manso que se muestra al tratar con personas, algunos padres confían en él incluso para proteger a sus hijos."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"With this wise Pokémon, there could be no concern that it would ever attack people. Some parents even trust it to babysit."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"賢く 人に 襲い掛かる 心配が ないので 子どもの お守りを 任せる 親も いる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Son long pelage le protège parfaitement du froid. Malheureusement pour lui, cela n’est pas très utile à Alola."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"El largo y cálido pelaje le permite soportar sin ningún problema el frío, pero resulta un poco asfixiante en Alola."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It pays no mind to the cold, thanks to its long warm coat. Stoutland in Alola look a little uncomfortable."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"長く 暖かい 毛の おかげで 寒さは へっちゃら。 アローラの ムーランドは 少し 苦しそうだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il possède un pelage long et épais. Jadis, dans les régions froides, chaque foyer en élevait un."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Posee un largo y tupido pelaje. En las regiones frías no había antaño una casa que no tuviese un Stoutland."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its fur is long and thick. A long time ago in cold regions, every household kept a Stoutland."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"長く 厚手の 体毛を もつ。 昔は 寒い 地方では 一家に １匹 ムーランドを 飼っていた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il apprécierait tant la compagnie des êtres humains qu’il ne faudrait pas plus de trois jours pour apprivoiser un Mastouffe sauvage."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Parece ser que le gusta vivir con personas. En tan solo tres días ya le coge cariño a cualquiera que lo haya atrapado en estado salvaje."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"These Pokémon seem to enjoy living with humans. Even a Stoutland caught in the wild will warm up to people in about three days."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"人と 暮らすのが 好きらしい。 野生で 捕まえても 3日も たてば 人に 懐くようになる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Sa moustache remarquable fait sa fierté, car sa longueur permettrait de déterminer la hiérarchie au sein de l’espèce."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Sus impresionantes bigotes son su orgullo. Entre los de su especie se establece una jerarquía según su longitud."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Stoutland is immensely proud of its impressive moustache. It’s said that moustache length is what determines social standing among this species."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"立派なヒゲが 自慢の ポケモン。 その 長さで 仲間同士の 優劣が 決まると いう。"}],"varieties":[{"id":508,"moves":[{"name":"tackle","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[11,"level-up",15],[14,"level-up",15],[15,"level-up",15],[16,"level-up",15],[17,"level-up",15],[18,"level-up",15],[20,"level-up",38]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",8],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",8],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",8],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",8],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",8],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",8],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[11,"level-up",29],[11,"machine",0],[14,"level-up",29],[14,"machine",0],[15,"level-up",29],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",29],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",29],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",29],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",62]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"mac